	(text "NOTE: ULN2803A VARIANT SELECTION (WHY VARIANT 3?)\n\nOut of the ULN2801-ULN2805 family, ULN2803A (Variant 3) is \nselected because it contains an internal 2.7kΩ base resistor\nspecifically matched for 5V TTL and 5V CMOS logic levels.\nIt allows direct connection to 5V digital GPIO pins without requiring \nexternal current-limiting resistors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 146.304 107.95 0)
